            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-insert-intro",
        "moduleId": "insert-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "插入数据",
        "markdown": "SQL 的数据插入语句 INSERT 通常有两种形式，一种是插入一个元组，另一种是插入子查询结果。后者可以一次插入多个元组。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000233"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "插入数据"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4375,
              "lineEnd": 4378,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "c32afe93514156ff58b485a24bfe1e7fc6953c133ff6f3a132ac8522fefd2061"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-insert-tuple",
        "moduleId": "insert-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "插入元组",
        "markdown": "插入元组的 INSERT 语句格式为：\n\n```sql\nINSERT INTO <表名> [(<属性列1> [,<属性列2>] ...)]\nVALUES (<常量1> [,<常量2>] ...);\n```\n\n其功能是将新元组插入指定表中。INTO 子句中没有出现的属性列，新元组在这些列上将取空值。但必须注意的是，在表定义时说明了 NOT NULL 的属性列不能取空值，否则会出错。如果 INTO 子句中没有指明任何属性列名，则新插入的元组必须在每个属性列上均有值。\n\n[例 3.69] 将新学生元组插入 Student 表：\n\n```sql\nINSERT INTO Student (Sno, Sname, Ssex, Sdept, Sage)\nVALUES ('201215128', '陈冬', '男', 'IS', 18);\n```\n\n[例 3.70] 省略属性名插入（属性列次序与 CREATE TABLE 中相同）：\n\n```sql\nINSERT INTO Student\nVALUES ('201215126', '张成民', '男', 18, 'CS');\n```\n\n[例 3.71] 插入一条选课记录，Grade 取空值：\n\n```sql\nINSERT INTO SC(Sno, Cno)\nVALUES ('201215128', '1');\n```\n\n或者显式给出 NULL：\n\n```sql\nINSERT INTO SC\nVALUES ('201215128', '1', NULL);\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000234"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "插入元组"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4379,
              "lineEnd": 4433,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3e5390794c480cb7969d96bfd9bd55b35872e88532c06be624144704c726725c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-insert-warning",
        "moduleId": "insert-data",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "插入操作的注意事项",
        "markdown": "省略属性名时，VALUES 子句中的值必须与 CREATE TABLE 中的属性列次序完全一致，否则会因为数据类型不匹配而出错。例如，如果将 ('201215126', '张成民', '男', 'CS', 18) 按此顺序插入 Student 表，则会把 'CS' 赋予 Sage 列、18 赋予 Sdept 列，导致类型错误。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-insert-tuple"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-insert-subquery",
        "moduleId": "insert-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "插入子查询结果",
        "markdown": "子查询不仅可以嵌套在 SELECT 语句中，也可以嵌套在 INSERT 语句中用以生成要插入的批量数据。插入子查询结果的格式为：\n\n```sql\nINSERT INTO <表名> [(<属性列1> [,<属性列2>...])]\n<子查询>;\n```\n\n[例 3.72] 对每一个系，求学生的平均年龄，并把结果存入数据库：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE Dept_age\n(Sdept CHAR(15),\n Avg_age SMALLINT);\n\nINSERT INTO Dept_age(Sdept, Avg_age)\nSELECT Sdept, AVG(Sage)\nFROM Student\nGROUP BY Sdept;\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000235"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "插入子查询结果"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4434,
              "lineEnd": 4464,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "cf7a5eced4b2870dec0d3dda666b48f70b6d623d3a65ee5667fb65ed63fb094f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-update-procedure",
        "moduleId": "update-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "修改数据",
        "markdown": "修改操作又称为更新操作，其语句的一般格式为：\n\n```sql\nUPDATE <表名>\nSET <列名>=<表达式> [,<列名>=<表达式>] ...\n[WHERE <条件>];\n```\n\n其功能是修改指定表中满足 WHERE 子句条件的元组。SET 子句给出表达式的值用于取代相应的属性列值。如果省略 WHERE 子句，则表示要修改表中的所有元组。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000236"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "修改数据"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4465,
              "lineEnd": 4476,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "8ca3674d90c670bb116d4f0be50647b07fbd4c546048e6077682d87b13a5a018"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-update-single",
        "moduleId": "update-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "修改单个元组",
        "markdown": "[例 3.73] 将学生 201215121 的年龄改为 22 岁：\n\n```sql\nUPDATE Student\nSET Sage=22\nWHERE Sno='201215121';\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000237"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "修改某一个元组的值"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4477,
              "lineEnd": 4486,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "5ec3593279a81ebf13fed0751bcc132da521c5bad545b21164348946c80f7b5f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-update-multiple",
        "moduleId": "update-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "修改多个元组",
        "markdown": "[例 3.74] 将所有学生的年龄增加 1 岁：\n\n```sql\nUPDATE Student\nSET Sage=Sage+1;\n```\n\n该语句省略了 WHERE 子句，因此会修改表中所有元组的 Sage 值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000238"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "修改多个元组的值"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4487,
              "lineEnd": 4497,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "17db892cd2ec577f32bf2a76aca57a3fcbb77f9181659dc1dc2763876a28e95f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-update-subquery",
        "moduleId": "update-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "带子查询的修改语句",
        "markdown": "子查询也可以嵌套在 UPDATE 语句中，用以构造修改的条件。\n\n[例 3.75] 将计算机科学系全体学生的成绩置零：\n\n```sql\nUPDATE SC\nSET Grade=0\nWHERE Sno IN\n  (SELECT Sno\n   FROM Student\n   WHERE Sdept='CS');\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000239"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "带子查询的修改语句"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4498,
              "lineEnd": 4512,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "89c8c84cdd81ddcae9139a5004815b624592e51a39628f7fa181c644b0ffbd30"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-delete-intro",
        "moduleId": "delete-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "删除数据",
        "markdown": "删除语句的一般格式为：\n\n```sql\nDELETE FROM <表名>\n[WHERE <条件>];\n```\n\nDELETE 语句的功能是从指定表中删除满足 WHERE 子句条件的所有元组。如果省略 WHERE 子句则表示删除表中全部元组，但表的定义仍在字典中。也就是说，DELETE 语句删除的是表中的数据，而不是关于表的定义。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000240"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "删除数据"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4513,
