      {
        "id": "tb-delete-multiple",
        "moduleId": "delete-data",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "删除多个元组",
        "markdown": "[例 3.77] 删除所有的学生选课记录：\n\n```sql\nDELETE FROM SC;\n```\n\n这条 DELETE 语句将使 SC 成为空表，它删除了 SC 的所有元组。",
        "provenance": {
